    "description": {
      "value": "At least one of your parents is a member of the notorious Red Mantis assassins, merciless killers for hire who rarely fail to claim their marks. Whether on purpose or by simple exposure, you were trained from a young age in the art of stalking and killing people.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Stealth skill and the Assassin Lore skill. You gain the Assurance skill feat with Stealth."
    },
